From 74a41c68edad03044b165cb8a27bd84c67c5ac4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aditi Bombe <196845785+adi05b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 10:58:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Repair states that contradict the recorded country at
 merge time

A state whose country is none of the record's countries is re-resolved inside
them (exact name, then admin and stop words dropped, then state_code), or
dropped. Only location_view changes; the raw location, which goes to the KG,
keeps the source's observed_name. Adds state_or_province.state_code and
migration 005 for it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
